  "limitations": [
    "The studies on the haptic oblique effect have used a limited set of stimuli (vertical, horizontal, and two main diagonals), which might preclude the observation of biases toward the closest diagonal.",
    "The analysis of constant errors in haptic oblique effect studies has not revealed systematic directional errors, which is a limitation for applying models like CA and DFT directly."
  ],
